stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> intent_collecting

    intent_collecting --> confirming_plan: plan_confirm card
    intent_collecting --> skill_launch_only: launch_skill card
    skill_launch_only --> intent_collecting: continue chat

    confirming_plan --> running: user confirms execution
    confirming_plan --> intent_collecting: user revises request

    running --> starting: create assessment
    starting --> selecting_resources: recommend_resources + plan
    selecting_resources --> preparing_payloads: choose mode and load resources
    preparing_payloads --> enhancing_payloads: enhancement needed
    preparing_payloads --> executing: no enhancement needed
    enhancing_payloads --> executing
    executing --> reporting
    reporting --> completed
    running --> failed: any stage error

    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
